{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫飲食資訊綜藝節目《美食強人》明晚（19日）首播，節目由視帝陳豪與視后龔嘉欣擔任主持，並由陳浚霆與林秀怡出任「探店專員」，引領觀眾發掘大灣區內「強中之強」的代表性美食。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:39:30.082828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:26:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T12:37:33.724084+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:33.745906+00:00","content_hash":"2d2de96f6715437f293d2e619a0521a514a56f020632346475967291e1cacbdd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}